      Marginal RDNA numerics of the bf16 power-iteration kernel vs the fp64-ish torch eigh reference: one variance element misses the rtol 1e-3 tolerance by ~7x (measured rel 7.07e-3 at index (33,1)). Compiles and runs on gfx1151; only the NVIDIA-calibrated tolerance is exceeded. The shaped-bucket scoring path this tests is NOT used by this port (unshaped buckets).
