      Demands bit-for-bit torch.equal agreement between two different bf16 Triton kernels (dense add_planes_spread vs score_shaped_rows); on gfx1151 the two reduction orders differ in the last bf16 bit(s). An exactness expectation calibrated on NVIDIA hardware, not an algorithmic fault. Unused path for this port.
